### Suggested 3‑Day Mini‑Itinerary (Family Friendly)

| Day | Morning | Afternoon | Evening |
|-----|---------|-----------|---------|
| **Day 1 (Nov 10)** | Arrive in Seoul, check into a hotel in Myeongdong or Insadong | Explore Myeongdong shopping street, try street food | Dinner at a local Korean BBQ restaurant |
| **Day 2 (Nov 11)** | **Gyeongbokgung Palace** – arrive at 09:00 to catch the guard ceremony | Walk to Bukchon Hanok Village, visit the National Folk Museum | Return to hotel, optional night stroll in Insadong |
| **Day 3 (Nov 12)** | **N Seoul Tower** – take the cable car or bus up Namsan Mountain | Visit the observation deck, enjoy lunch at the revolving restaurant | Sunset view from the tower, then dinner in Itaewon or Hongdae |

